&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="width: 131.333px; padding: 0in 5.4pt;" valign="top"&gt;
&lt;p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; tab-stops: .5in 1.0in 1.5in 2.0in 2.5in 3.0in 3.5in 4.0in 4.5in 5.0in 5.5in 6.0in 6.5in 7.0in; mso-layout-grid-align: none; text-autospace: none;" align="right"&gt;&lt;font style="font-size: 10.0pt;"&gt;1,500&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
