    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value19" xlink:to="footnote19" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="19" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote22" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Mr. Cosby was appointed President and Chief Executive Officer effective February 1, 2025. Mr. Cosby served as Chief Operating Officer from October 2024 to January 31, 2025, and as Senior Vice President and Chief Operating Officer from December 2023 to October 2024.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value22" xlink:to="footnote22" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="22" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote23" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Mr. Wise was appointed Senior Vice President and Chief Operating Officer effective January 1, 2026. Mr. Wise served as Senior Vice President of Power Supply from October 2024 to December 31, 2025.</xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:from="value23" xlink:to="footnote23" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" order="23" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xml:lang="en-US" xlink:label="footnote26" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
      <xhtml:div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <xhtml:p>Mr. Lee resigned as President and Chief Executive Officer of ODEC effective February 1, 2025, and served as Senior Advisor from February 1, 2025 to December 31, 2025.  Mr. Lee served as President and Chief Executive Officer from February 6, 2024 until February 1, 2025; and served as Interim President and Chief Executive Officer from September 8, 2023 to February 5, 2024.  </xhtml:p>
      </xhtml:div>
    </link:footnote>
